WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.583
I have to treat them nice, do it with a smile, do everything I can just to keep the situation calm.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.833
Do what I got to do.

00:00:24.916 --> 00:00:27.666
Customers are customers.

00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:30.625
Sometimes you get nice ones and sometimes you get not so nice ones.

00:00:29.666 --> 00:00:35.250
I'm going to go ahead and check and see how they're doing, fill some drinks, and hopefully it goes well.

00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:42.791
So guys, how is everything going here?

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:45.083
Can you take any longer with our drinks?

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.375
Actually, the bartender is working on that.

00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:49.666
They're working as fast as they can.

00:00:48.708 --> 00:00:50.583
I promise you'll they'll be out.

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:50.958
The bartender.

00:00:50.041 --> 00:00:53.166
There's always excuses, always excuses.

00:00:52.291 --> 00:00:56.958
Yeah, I'm really sorry, like I said, I put your order in.

00:00:56.125 --> 00:00:58.166
It's on its way.

00:00:57.333 --> 00:00:59.625
They're working as fast as they can.

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.625
And our food?

00:00:59.708 --> 00:01:00.958
Actually, I put the order in.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.666
It should be out in probably 5 minutes.

00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:02.833
5 minutes?

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.583
Make it 3.

00:01:02.625 --> 00:01:07.041
Okay, well I'll go ahead, check on it, and see if they can get it out any faster.

00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:07.541
I'll be back.

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:07.750
I'll let you know how it's going.

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:09.583
Yeah, you do that.

00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:09.875
Alright.
